%% Figure: Processing sequence for a standard citizen report.
%% Render to: Images/Chapter 3/report-submission-sequence.png
sequenceDiagram
    participant Citizen
    participant Identity as Identity simulator
    participant Relayer
    participant AI as AI aggregator
    participant IPFS
    participant Chain as Reporting contract

    Citizen->>Identity: Authenticate and request tickets
    Identity-->>Citizen: Signed ticket batch and citizen seed
    Citizen->>Citizen: Hash images and sign composite report hash
    Citizen->>Relayer: Submit signed report, ticket, and media
    Relayer->>Relayer: Verify ticket signature and citizen signature
    Relayer->>AI: Request moderation decision
    AI-->>Relayer: Return accept or reject
    Relayer->>IPFS: Store accepted complaint envelope
    IPFS-->>Relayer: Return content identifier
    Relayer->>Chain: Submit report with CID and hashes
    Chain-->>Relayer: Confirm PendingValidation
    Relayer-->>Citizen: Stream progress over SSE
